      "id": "sol.amc-10a-2002-p1.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Factoring gives \\[\\dfrac{10^{2000}(1+100)}{2\\cdot 10^{2001}}=\\dfrac{101}{20}=5.05,\\] which is closest to \\(5.\\)\n\nThus, the correct answer is D.",
